### SUPER_ADMIN login (set cookie)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "super_admin@codeit.com",
  "password": "1q2w3e4r!"
}

### Update company information (SUPER_ADMIN only)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users/user-1/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "CodeDown",
  "passwordData": {
    "newPassword": "newpassword123",
    "newPasswordConfirm": "newpassword123"
  }
}

### Reset company information to mock-data values
PATCH http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users/user-1/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Codeit",
  "passwordData": {
    "newPassword": "11111111",
    "newPasswordConfirm": "11111111"
  }
}

### Update company name only
PATCH http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users/user-1/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Updated Company Name"
}

### Update password only
PATCH http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users/user-1/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passwordData": {
    "newPassword": "newpassword456@",
    "newPasswordConfirm": "newpassword456@"
  }
}

### Error case: both company name and password are missing
PATCH http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users/user-1/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

### Error case: password confirmation mismatch
PATCH http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users/user-1/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passwordData": {
    "newPassword": "password123",
    "newPasswordConfirm": "password456"
  }
}

### Error case: password shorter than 8 characters
PATCH http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users/user-1/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passwordData": {
    "newPassword": "123",
    "newPasswordConfirm": "123"
  }
} 
=== Company user list ====
### SUPER_ADMIN login (set cookie)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "super_admin@codeit.com",
  "password": "1q2w3e4r!"
}

### Get all company users (first page)
GET http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users?limit=15

### Get next page
GET http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users?cursor=user-1

### Search by name
GET http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users?name=admin

### Search by name + pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users?name=user&cursor=user-4

### Set page size (3 items each)
GET http://localhost:8080/super-admin/users?limit=3
